# HR Analytics Dashboard (Power BI)

## Overview
An interactive Power BI dashboard that analyses HR data, covering salary 
by country, department and year, and employee status by age.

## Dataset
- **File:** HR_SAMPLE_DATASET.xlsx (sheet: HR_Sample_Dataset)

## Visuals
| Visual | Shows |
|---|---|
| Bar chart | Country-wise Salary |
| Pie / donut chart | Age-wise Status |
| Column chart | Salary by Department |
| Line chart | Year-wise Salary |

## Slicers
- Gender
- Status
- Country

All visuals respond to the slicers, and the dashboard layout has no empty 
white space.

